          <p style="font:400 14.5px/1.6 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Every guardrail sat on the user prompt. Nothing sanitized the documents the assistant ingested. Instructions inside a PDF caused a tool call that exported data belonging to another tenant. The fix was authorization at the tool layer rather than prompt tuning.</p>
